        {
          "type": "improvement",
          "priority": "low",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-05T12:11:54Z",
          "note": "strategy.js uses function hoisting (nested function declarations inside renderStrategyList) which is idiomatic for the SPA's module-less pattern, but the increasing number of inner helpers (wireToggle, wireRegisterButtons, refreshTable, buildToggleHtml) means the function is growing. A future refactor could extract these into module-level helpers scoped by a closure, similar to how renderStrategyDetail is structured."
