        },
        {
          "type": "improvement",
          "priority": "low",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-05T12:11:54Z",
          "note": "The 'Register' button pre-fills the ID field with the raw folder name, which may contain characters invalid for a repo ID slug (SLUG_REGEX requires alphanumeric/hyphens/underscores). A lightweight client-side sanitiser (replacing spaces and dots with hyphens, stripping disallowed chars) would prevent a confusing server-side VALIDATION_ERROR after the user clicks Add without realising the ID needs adjustment."
        }
      ]
    },
